    "methods_description": "Participants studied visually presented word lists organized into semantic categories (12 items per list, 6 pairs from 3 different categories), completed arithmetic distractor tasks, and performed free recall. Intracranial EEG recordings were acquired using multiple systems and standardized to voltage units (V). Monopolar recordings were referenced (typically mastoid) and bipolar recordings followed paired electrode schemes. MNI and Talairach coordinates with brain region annotations are provided for each subject's unique electrode montage.",
